NAME
    spawn - start an embedded program, or the armed image

SYNOPSIS
    spawn [NAME]

DESCRIPTION
    With NAME, start one of the programs built into this system image (for
    example hello, captest or fs_server). With no NAME, start the image
    most recently armed by the loader.

    The new task has its own address space and only the capabilities it
    is given. There is no ambient authority: a task can do nothing its
    capability space does not name.

SEE ALSO
    run(1), ps(1), sudo(1), capabilities(7)
